+    The gate reads `effective_severity(entry)`. The proof recomputes R_k. This
+    returns True only when those agree to within the proof's own tolerance, so a
+    proof that demonstrably computed a different quantity cannot license a
+    release. A missing or non-numeric proof figure returns False: absence of a
+    comparable number is not agreement.
