+    "what": "`~/.claude/hooks/local_resource_budget.py` runs before every delegated Agent, Task and Workflow call and stops delegated work launching the project's heavy verification on a machine with 8 cores, 8 GiB and a measured heavy budget of 1. On 2026-11-13 it refused 2 adversarial-review briefs of mine, both of which FORBADE delegated heavy runs in as many words. Chasing that refusal, its live predicate was imported and driven over a systematic grid: 5 ordinary verbs of execution x 10 noun phrases this project uses for its own suite x 3 sentence tails, 150 cells, every one a genuine instruction that should be refused. 126 pass straight through.",
